  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.12\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* feat: copy data values, presentation texts and due date when copying an instance by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1872\n* feat: store source instance id in data values when copying an instance by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1882\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* feat: validate data annotations on cleaned data when RemoveHiddenData is enabled by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1866\n* fix: handle Map component geometry bindings when removing hidden data by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1861\n* fix: return a simple HTML page when copy validation fails and the browser prefers html by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1869\n* fix: read PDF format data through the instance-based GetFormData so data types that allow application/json don't fail with 500 by @lonnkvist in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1870\n* fix(api): remove stray OpenAPI path parameters by @olemartinorg in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1871\n* fix: reuse LayoutEvaluatorState in legacy LayoutEvaluatorStateInitializer.Init by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1877\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* chore(deps): update actions/setup-dotnet action to v6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1845\n* chore(deps): update actions/add-to-project digest to cea7931 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1842\n* chore(deps): update actions/cache action to v6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1835\n* chore(deps): update nuget non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1840\n* chore(deps): update github-actions non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1841\n* chore(deps): update nuget non-major dependencies that build and pass tests by @ivarne-agent in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1883\n* chore(deps): update CSharpier.Core to 1.3.0 and test Roslyn to 5.3.0 by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1885\n### Other Changes\n* fix: enable the legacy PDF only for an explicit enablePdfCreation by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1867\n## New Contributors\n* @lonnkvist made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1870\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.11...v8.12.12",
